# --- 2026-07-25 accounts (Sign in with Apple, Stage 1) ---
# The dev server's account storage. accounts.json holds Apple's per-app identifier for each
# player and sessions.json holds live session tokens, so none of these may ever reach this
# public repo. The Deno production server keeps the same six things in KV, not on disk.
server/accounts.json
server/account-index.json
server/sessions.json
server/auth-nonces.json
server/accounts-leaderboard.json
server/claims.json
# The Sign in with Apple key, when Blake creates it (same treatment as the APNs key above).
server/apple-key.p8
server/apple-key-id.txt
